OL,3,AUganda begins withdrawing troops from
OL,4,ASomalia after 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FUganda has begun withdrawing its troops
OL,7,Ffrom Somalia after nearly two decades
OL,8,Fof military involvement in the country.
OL,10,FThe first contingent of 109 Uganda
OL,11,FPeople's Defence Forces (UPDF) troops
OL,12,Freportedly left the capital, Mogadishu,
OL,13,Fon Friday, following an announcement by
OL,14,FUganda's army chief, Gen Muhoozi
OL,15,FKainerugaba.
OL,17,FUganda's acting army spokesperson,
OL,18,FChris Magezi, did not respond to the
OL,19,FBBC's request for comment.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
